BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b53f33f9-2bbf-3fd3-a9e4-ea481e6cf404.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
